    "text": "By WPTA Staff ,\n8 hours ago FORT WAYNE, Ind. (WPTA) - More road closures are coming to Fort Wayne’s north side. According to city officials, Clinton Street will be closed between Wallen Road and Brooks Road beginning on Monday, March 23. They say crews will be completing road improvements. Drivers are asked to detour on... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
